{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>After a terrible fall you wake up confused and without legs. All hope is not lost though, for there is a tale of a witch with immense powers, so powerful that she can even regrow limbs. Punch yourself to the top, find the witch and restore yourself to your former glory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game </h2>Just Arms is a physics platformer with limited controls. You will have to spin your arms and charge up enough force to then punch yourself in the opposite direction. One mistake and you're back down at the bottom!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1215750/extras/ff4e1dbc674a676bd3f590bdc29112e1.avif?t=1750160759\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging and addicting gameplay<br></li><li> huge levels filled with interesting characters<br></li><li> Different areas, such as forest, winter and town area<br></li><li> Each area presents a different challenge<br></li><li> PvP online multiplayer with up to 60 players where you race to the top to win<br></li><li> Unlockable skins<br></li><li> Steam achievements</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bffedf3e152e502ce9a8fb76ca24a0d2e5a364e2.jpg","localized_name":"One third!","name":"One third!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1215750/bffedf3e152e502ce9a8fb76ca24a0d2e5a364e2.jpg"},{"icon":"34c65775488573ee5f8926eb93d3d01c79fcf5c5.jpg","localized_name":"Holy crap! A talking skull!","name":"Holy crap! A talking skull!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1215750/34c65775488573ee5f8926eb93d3d01c79fcf5c5.jpg"},{"icon":"3fa6a442c171d41db6f2f1a1af4c45508148d349.jpg","localized_name":"Two thirds!","name":"Two thirds!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1215750/3fa6a442c171d41db6f2f1a1af4c45508148d349.jpg"},{"icon":"10f4f8